@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam dpi 180
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam linetype ortho

title RAG问答处理流程

start
:接收 query + history;
:构建检索查询\n(融合历史上下文);
:向量检索 Top-K\n(Chroma/BGE-m3);
:计算 best_similarity;

if (best_similarity < 阈值?) then (是)
  :进入 Direct LLM 模式;
  :生成通用/低风险回答;
else (否)
  :拼接 references + prompt;
  :调用模型生成回答\n(Ollama/DeepSeek/本地模型);
endif

:附加 references 与免责声明;
:返回 answer / references / used_llm;
stop

note right
END
end note

@enduml

